  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400\u00b0F. Line large sheet pan with parchment paper.",
    "Combine oil, garlic, oregano, basil, salt, and pepper in a small bowl; whisk.",
    "Place zucchini on pan. Drizzle with half the oil mixture; mix well. Bake 10 minutes.",
    "Add shrimp to pan; mix well.",
    "Drizzle with remaining oil mixture; sprinkle with Parmesan. Bake 6\u20138 minutes until shrimp is firm and opaque and zucchini is tender-crisp.",
    "Drizzle with lemon juice; sprinkle with parsley. Serve immediately."
  ],
  "notes": "230 kcal per serving. Prep 15 min / Cook 18 min."
}